{"id":"570349aa538831d0","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md","title":"Canonical Model for GL","display":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-canonical-model-gl","aliases":["89-thm-canonical-model-gl"],"display":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-thm-canonical-model]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-canonical-model-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-canonical-model-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74\" href=\"?note=d5bc3d5ff97b8f74\" title=\"89-thm-canonical-model\">89-thm-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为一致正规逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 87、90–91；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是一般典范模型定理的 GL 实例。非定理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的否定扩张为局部极大一致世界；正向验证全部世界仍然只使用典范赋值。GL 的典范框架可有自环，因此本定理不提供有限逆良基框架完全性的替代证明。后者使用第 5 章的有限类型和严格增加盒公式的关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1232,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-504","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl]]"}],"outgoing":["6f068c38418e21f2","d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}